\# NeuroSentinel



\*\*AI Security for Multi-Agent LLM Pipelines\*\*



NeuroSentinel is a production-grade security system that detects and tracks compromise in multi-agent LLM pipelines using dual-layer detection (LSTM structural + semantic drift) and GNN propagation tracking.



\## Quick Start



\### Installation



```bash

pip install neurosentinel

